sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SM as Site Manager
    participant UI as Selected-site page
    participant Dialog as ConfirmActionDialog or DecisionDialog
    participant API as Operational API
    participant Scope as Role, assignment, active-site, and source checks
    participant Service as Domain service
    participant Audit as Tenant or site audit writer
    participant DB as Tenant database
    participant Handoff as Tenant Admin handoff or artifact delivery

    SM->>UI: Choose risky action in active selected site

    alt Access-request decision
        UI->>Dialog: Show request, selected site, evidence, effect, and reason rule
        alt Reject without nonblank reason
            UI-->>SM: Inline reason validation; do not submit
        else Approve or valid rejection
            Dialog-->>SM: Confirm decision
        end
    else Unresolved-event escalation
        UI->>Dialog: Show event, source, selected site, severity, impact, and required reason
        alt Missing reason
            UI-->>SM: Inline reason validation; do not submit
        else Valid escalation
            Dialog-->>SM: Confirm escalation
        end
    else Selected-site export
        UI->>Dialog: Show selected site, filters, format, data scope, and export impact
        Dialog-->>SM: Confirm export request
    end

    SM->>Dialog: Confirm
    Dialog->>UI: Lock duplicate submit and show pending state
    UI->>API: Send action, scope, reason where required, and idempotency context
    API->>Scope: Verify SITE_MANAGER, tenant, UserSite assignment, active site, and source ownership

    alt Scope denied, site disabled, or resource unavailable
        Scope-->>API: 403, SITE_DISABLED, or non-disclosing 404
        API-->>UI: Generic unavailable or disabled-site result
        UI->>Dialog: Keep safe context or return to active scope state
        Dialog-->>SM: No cross-site or tenant-wide data disclosure
    else Scope allowed
        Scope-->>API: Permit selected-site action
        API->>Service: Validate current request, event, export, or commissioning state

        alt Stale request, duplicate escalation, invalid export, or validation conflict
            Service-->>API: Conflict or validation result
            API-->>UI: Prior server state remains authoritative
            UI->>Dialog: Preserve safe input and offer refresh or retry
        else Valid action
            Service->>DB: Write decision, escalation, or export request
            Service->>Audit: Append actor, selected site, target, reason, action, and outcome
            Audit->>DB: Persist immutable operational audit in same transaction

            alt Audit write fails
                DB-->>Audit: Audit failure
                Audit-->>Service: Fail transaction
                Service-->>API: Action not completed
                API-->>UI: Failure; never claim success or release artifact
                UI->>Dialog: Restore focus and offer retry
            else Audit written
                DB-->>Audit: Audit and correlation reference
                alt Escalation
                    Audit->>Handoff: Send approved Tenant Admin handoff through outbox
                    Handoff-->>Service: Escalation outcome
                else Export
                    Audit->>Handoff: Release audited selected-site artifact
                    Handoff-->>Service: Artifact outcome
                end
                Audit-->>Service: Durable action outcome
                Service-->>API: Updated resource or result plus audit and correlation reference
                API-->>UI: Confirmed server result
                UI->>UI: Refresh selected-site state
                UI-->>SM: Inline durable feedback; toast is supplementary only
            end
        end
    end

    Note over SM,DB: Active selected site narrows work but never grants authority beyond server assignment checks.
    Note over API,Handoff: Escalation requires an approved permission-matrix/API policy row before release.
